@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
title Course registration - R1-R5
autonumber
actor Student
participant RegistrationService
participant Catalog
participant EnrollmentRepository
Student -> RegistrationService : browseCatalog(semester)
RegistrationService -> Catalog : getOfferings(semester)
Catalog --> RegistrationService : course code, title, offeringId, semester, availablePlaces
RegistrationService --> Student : showCatalog(code, title, offeringId, availablePlaces)
note over Student, Catalog
R1: availablePlaces = capacity - current enrollment count.
Catalog is a snapshot; viewing reserves no place.
end note
Student -> Student : selectOffering(offeringId)
Student -> RegistrationService : register(studentId, offeringId)
group Atomic registration for the selected offering (R2-R5)
note over RegistrationService, EnrollmentRepository
All requests for this offering are serialized here.
Final duplicate and capacity checks plus creation form
one atomic operation; no competing request interleaves.
end note
RegistrationService -> EnrollmentRepository : existsEnrollment(studentId, offeringId)
EnrollmentRepository --> RegistrationService : alreadyEnrolled
RegistrationService -> EnrollmentRepository : getCurrentCountAndCapacity(offeringId)
EnrollmentRepository --> RegistrationService : count, capacity
alt already enrolled
RegistrationService --> Student : reject: already enrolled (R3, R5)
note right of EnrollmentRepository : No new record; count unchanged.
else course full and not already enrolled
RegistrationService --> Student : reject: course full (R2, R5)
note right of EnrollmentRepository : No new record; count unchanged.
else not enrolled and places left (count < capacity)
RegistrationService -> EnrollmentRepository : createEnrollment(studentId, offeringId)
EnrollmentRepository --> RegistrationService : enrollmentId; count = oldCount + 1
RegistrationService -> RegistrationService : availablePlaces = capacity - count
RegistrationService --> Student : confirm(enrollmentId, offeringId, availablePlaces) (R4)
end
end
@enduml
